y dog is happy. You can customize your dog to be whatever you want, and you can play with others whenever and wherever you want.", "short_description": "Dog Park VR lets you be a dog and play carefree. The game has many game modes; one second you're in space, then you're building your dream house. There is plenty to do in this fun game. So what are you waiting for? Join the fun!"}]}, "developer_name": "Electric", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mep478/dog-park-stuff/main/privacy%20policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Electric", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dogparkvr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "29899611343020748"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307420_1162485395638280_6944087713918222057_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zo9GvF3tIzIQ7kNvwHAvczj&_nc_oc=AdnVrW2rMY7wqPa201ym2am8sg7qXuZuq1LYb80q72Li_z1gsYm_MOhq29ouayZvVRw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs2MX6XLpA9Q6xDW8i5gMRR4KhEiaM5CwJYK-QSbWeGDA&oe=69A598B6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Dog Park VR", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "cont